1
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,520
Are you serious?

2
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,400
What, scared?

3
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,080
Shu Tinglan,

4
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,760
you've really been brainwashed
by Lin Zhinan.

5
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,410
How could you lose your head

6
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,280
and do something so crazy?

7
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,020
I wasn't supposed to see him tonight.

8
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,490
I thought I'd dodge the class reunion,

9
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,700
only to run into him on the street.

10
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,400
Never expected it

11
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:07,040
to be Zhuo Yu'an.

12
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:08,960
After all these years,

13
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:10,920
he still remembers me.

14
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:55,880
[Unsoiled Starlight]

15
00:01:55,910 --> 00:01:57,720
[Episode 1]

16
00:01:57,750 --> 00:01:58,170
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

17
00:01:58,190 --> 00:01:58,640
[Original Auther: Shan Gu Jun]

18
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:02,470
[Three hours ago]

19
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,680
To our cooperation!

20
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,880
-To our cooperation!
-To our cooperation!

21
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:05,410
Cheers to our cooperation!

22
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:10,199
I negotiated this case myself,

23
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,130
but she took all the credit.

24
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:12,760
Mr. Chen.

25
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,320
One more toast to you!

26
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,760
Here, let me top you up.

27
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,600
Maybe,

28
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,180
toasting counts more than real work.

29
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,980
You're Ms. Shu, right?

30
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,260
She's Shu Tinglan.

31
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,960
Do you know the secret to surviving

32
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,760
as an independent woman at work?

33
00:02:29,079 --> 00:02:30,540
It's knowing when to bend.

34
00:02:30,950 --> 00:02:32,520
In a situation like this,

35
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:35,000
you have to drink!

36
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,120
Mr. Chen,

37
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:41,480
let me toast you.

38
00:02:43,150 --> 00:02:44,280
That's more like it.

39
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:44,960
Come on!

40
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:46,980
Here's to independent women!

41
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:40,670
[Zhuoyuan Technology's
New Product Launch]

42
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,130
Welcome, everyone,

43
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:44,800
to Zhuoyuan Technology's
new product launch.

44
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,700
Nice to see you.

45
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,120
I'm Zhuo Yu'an.

46
00:03:48,070 --> 00:03:51,240
[Zhuoyuan Technology's
New Product Launch]

47
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:04,640
Hello.

48
00:04:04,790 --> 00:04:05,280
Zhinan.

49
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,480
Hey,

50
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,440
Shu Tinglan,

51
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,520
are you coming to the reunion tonight?

52
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,560
I've got a difficult client.

53
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,120
I probably can't make it.

54
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:17,800
Then take care.

55
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,079
Handle it or give up.

56
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,839
Yeah, I know.

57
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,200
It's so noisy over there.

58
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:27,360
Hey, hurry up.

59
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:30,640
Zhuo Yu'an will be here too.

60
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,920
Isn't he your high school crush?

61
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:35,640
What are you talking about?

62
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:36,880
Don't mind him.

63
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,560
Come on. I'm hanging up.

64
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:39,360
Let's go.

65
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,090
What nonsense are you talking?

66
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,400
Come join us!

67
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,760
Tinglan,

68
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,540
you're really not coming?

69
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:55,920
I'm not.

70
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,520
Have fun.

71
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:11,720
How am I supposed to face you?

72
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:16,400
Tired, smelling of alcohol,
and down on my luck,

73
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:18,520
my life feels dead and stuck,

74
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:21,280
while you're still as dazzling as ever.

75
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:23,480
Our paths won't cross again.

76
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,120
Am I right,

77
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,640
Zhuo Yu'an?

78
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,320
Mr. Zhuo!

79
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,700
Mr. Zhuo, can we have a quick word?

80
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,120
Mr. Zhuo!

81
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,000
Mr. Zhuo, please wait!

82
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,480
Mr. Zhuo, please answer a few questions!

83
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,409
Just a few words!

84
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,650
Please, say something!

85
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,320
Mr. Zhuo!

86
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:45,680
Jiajia.

87
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,940
You're my pick on your team.

88
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:49,050
Thank you, Mr. Chen.

89
00:05:49,050 --> 00:05:51,760
-Let me get the car door for you.
-Let's drink again.

90
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,400
Jiajia,

91
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,800
see you next time.

92
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,159
Okay.

93
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:56,220
-Bye, Mr. Chen.
-Take care, Mr. Chen.

94
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,400
Deng.

95
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:51,720
[No cars available]

96
00:07:11,590 --> 00:07:12,600
Little thing.

97
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,480
Why are you all alone here,

98
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,440
just like me?

99
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,640
Zhuo Yu'an?

100
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:43,960
Zhuo Yu'an!

101
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:47,720
Thanks!

102
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,400
It's snowing.

103
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,220
It's hard to get a cab here.

104
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,450
I'll give you a ride.

105
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:22,360
Get in.

106
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,820
What, am I your cab driver?

107
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:38,290
Take the front seat.

108
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:24,760
Where to?

109
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,330
47 Yongan East Road.

110
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,720
Thanks, Mr. Zhuo.

111
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,930
That's a little formal.

112
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,760
I was afraid you wouldn't remember me.

113
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:35,440
After all...

114
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,300
I remember you.

115
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:38,610
We were at the same high school.

116
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,120
Shu Tinglan.

117
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:56,380
I saw you wrestling
with that trash bag earlier.

118
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,640
Yeah.

119
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:00,480
I mistook it for a kitten.

120
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:02,880
You like cats?

121
00:11:03,810 --> 00:11:04,960
Not particularly.

122
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:07,320
But I couldn't just ingore it

123
00:11:10,560 --> 00:11:12,160
since.. since I saw it.

124
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:14,480
Yeah.

125
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:17,960
Exactly.
